{
  "slug": "shieldcode",
  "name": "Shieldcode",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Security hardening and production-grade error handling expertise for Claude Code. Prevents OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities (SQL injection, XSS,\nbroken auth, secrets exposure) and enforces structured error handling, secure logging, and proper HTTP status codes. Auto-activates when\nwriting code that handles user input, database queries, authentication, API endpoints, or error handling. 991 lines of battle-tested security\npatterns with BAD vs SAFE examples in TypeScript and Python.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `shieldcode` (Security hardening and production-grade error handling for all code Claude generates).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install shieldcode@claude-community` from `nikolasdehor/shieldcode`.\n\n62% of AI-generated code contains at least one security vulnerability.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
